Are you ready to grow into a ServiceNow expert and build smart, scalable solutions that truly make a difference? Join ITAM Solutions as a ServiceNow Developer and help shape the foundation of our office in Valencia, while working with an experienced and ambitious international team.
What You’ll Do
As a ServiceNow Developer, you’ll be part of a collaborative environment where you work on impactful projects for clients in healthcare, finance, and high-tech industries. Your role includes building and improving workflows, integrating systems, and turning business needs into technical solutions that are future-proof and efficient.
Your responsibilities will include:
Developing and customizing applications within the ServiceNow platform;
Configuring and implementing out-of-the-box ServiceNow modules, such as SAM Pro and ITOM;
Writing and maintaining JavaScript code;
Translating business requirements into clear technical implementations;
Collaborating with consultants and stakeholders in both Spain and the Netherlands;
Participating in testing, documentation, and ongoing platform improvement;
Staying up to date with ServiceNow best practices and platform releases.
What You Bring
Basic to intermediate knowledge of JavaScript;
Genuine interest in ServiceNow development and motivation to grow;
Analytical thinking and strong problem-solving skills;
Solid communication and team collaboration abilities.
Nice to have (but not required):
Hands-on experience with ServiceNow or similar ITSM/ITAM platforms;
Experience with or interest in implementing ServiceNow SAM Pro or ITOM modules;
Affinity with web development or data modelling;
Understanding of ITIL or IT asset management concepts;
Relevant ServiceNow certifications (CSA, CAD, CIS).
What We Offer
A pivotal role in building our new team in Valencia;
Personal development opportunities within a fast-growing international company;
A supportive and informal work environment with room for ownership;
Full remote work to start, transitioning to a hybrid setup in a centrally located office;
Direct impact and visibility in a company that values initiative;
Collaboration with skilled colleagues in both Spain and the Netherlands.
About ITAM Solutions
ITAM Solutions is a leading consultancy in IT Asset Management and a certified ServiceNow partner. They help organizations gain visibility and control over their IT landscapes, combining strategic advice, strong tooling, and a human-centric approach. From their offices in the Netherlands and Spain, they deliver scalable solutions that are built for the future. And with multiple years of Great Place to Work certification, they know how to combine quality with culture.
Ready to Apply?
We’d love to hear from you! Apply here or send your CV to Hupp-IT, our recruitment partner for ITAM Solutions.
Let’s build something great together.
